    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's just annoying because i don't really have time to go to a clinic during the work day. do you think it's worth worrying about if it's just a little bit of burning? i mean, if it's just acid reflux, i can probably just manage it with some extra antacids or maybe even some ibuprofen if it feels more like a muscle thing?",
